# Armory rules, the Rules tab and the item panel. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.Rules.

TabItems: Items
TabItemsHint: The armory's storage and issue rows.
TabRules: Rules
TabRulesHint: The armory's rule list. It decides which weapons the levies draw.

AddClass: + Class balance
AddClassHint: Sets how many levies carry each class.
AddCategory: + Category rule
AddCategoryHint: Prefers, orders, includes or requires a kind of weapon, such as bows.
AddList: + Item list
AddListHint: Names items that are never used, or the only items used.
Reset: Reset
ResetHint: Replaces the list with the default. Item overrides stay.
OrderNote: Rules apply from the top. When two disagree, the upper one wins.
On: "On"
Off: "Off"
OnHint: Turns this block on or off.
RemoveHint: Removes this block.
UpHint: Moves this block up.
DownHint: Moves this block down.
Kind_ClassBalance: Class balance
Kind_Category: Category rule
Kind_ItemList: Item list

Mode_Weight: Weight
Mode_Over: Order
Mode_Include: Include
Mode_Min: At least
ModeHint_Weight: Multiplies the rank of every weapon in the category.
ModeHint_Over: Weapons of the first category are always chosen before the second.
ModeHint_Include: Every weapon in the category is put to use.
ModeHint_Min: At least this many levies carry a weapon in the category.
CategoryHint: The kind of weapon this rule is about.
OtherHint: The kind of weapon that comes second.
OverWord: before

List_Never: Never use
List_Only: Only use
ListModeHint: Never use bars the items. Only use bars everything else.
AddItemHint: Hold an item and click to add it.
TypeNumber: Type a number

ColWeight: Share
ColMin: At least
ColMax: At most
ColFixed: Exactly
ColStock: Stock
Auto: auto
NoLimit: none

StatusOff: This block is off.
StatusWeight: "{0} {1} in stock, ranked x{2}."
StatusOverSame: Pick two different categories.
StatusOverNone: "No {0} in stock. The rule has no effect."
StatusOver: "{0} come before {1}. {2} {0} and {3} {1} in stock."
StatusIncludeNone: "No {0} in stock."
StatusInclude: "All {0} {1} are used."
StatusMin: "{0} {1} wanted, {2} in stock."
StatusFewLevies: "Only {0} levies."
BlockedOrder: "Block {0} puts {1} before {2}."
BlockedClass: "Block {0} limits {1} to {2}."
StatusListEmpty: This list is empty.
StatusOnly: "Only these {0} items are used."
StatusNever: "{0} items are never used."
StatusClassShort: "{0} {1} wanted, {2} in stock."
StatusClassShadowed: An earlier class balance block is in use. This one is ignored.
StatusClassFree: No numbers set. Armor and stock decide.
StatusClassPlan: "For {0} levies: {1}."
StatusClassSet: Numbers are set.

InfoRankSet: Rank
RankModeHint: Auto uses the computed rank. Set uses your number. Never keeps the item out. Prefer uses it before all others.
InfoClass: Class
InfoCategories: Categories
AddCategoryShort: Add category
AddCategoryTagHint: Adds a category to this item in this armory.
RemoveCategoryHint: Removes this category from the item in this armory.
ResetItem: Reset item
ResetItemHint: Clears the rank and tag edits for this item.
ItemNote: Edits apply to this armory.
ClassAuto: Auto
ClassNone: None
ClassEditHint: Sets the class this item counts as in this armory.
RankMode_Auto: Auto
RankMode_Set: Set
RankMode_Never: Never use
RankMode_Prefer: Prefer
NoCategory: no category

InfoKind: "{0}. Class: {1}."
InfoUnsupported: Levies cannot use this item.
InfoStats: "Damage {0}. Use time {1}. Crit {2}%."
InfoMana: "Costs {0} mana."
InfoAmmo: Needs ammo.
InfoTierNone: No tier known.
InfoTierPast: "Tier: {0}. The world is {1} stages past it."
InfoTierAhead: "Tier: {0}. Not reached yet."
InfoBarred: A list rule bars this item.
InfoRank: "Rank {0}"
